1
00:02:42,870 --> 00:02:47,660
Mokku, witches come out on nights like this. You must never go outside.

2
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:49,440
A witch?

3
00:02:50,105 --> 00:02:56,180
That's right. On full moon nights like this, the witch who lives in the Enchanted Forest comes out to kidnap children.

4
00:02:57,550 --> 00:02:59,220
What does she do after kidnapping them?

5
00:03:00,005 --> 00:03:02,160
She drinks their blood.

6
00:03:02,574 --> 00:03:03,574
Their blood?

7
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:04,800
Yes.

8
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,880
That is why children must not stay out late playing.

9
00:03:16,084 --> 00:03:20,500
That's a lie. It's just a story grownups made up to stop kids from going out.

10
00:03:21,550 --> 00:03:23,700
It is not made up!

11
00:03:23,950 --> 00:03:26,780
The witch in the Enchanted Forest is a vampire.

12
00:03:28,370 --> 00:03:30,380
Come on now, Mokku, go to sleep.

13
00:03:30,584 --> 00:03:32,000
I'm not sleepy.

14
00:03:32,105 --> 00:03:33,620
You're a good boy, aren't you, Mokku?

15
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:38,660
Keep that up and Grandpa won't help you if the vampire comes and carries you off.

16
00:03:39,500 --> 00:03:41,060
How boring.

17
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:43,980
See? You're sleepy after all.

18
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:49,980
Boring, so boring. I wish school didn't exist. I hate school!

19
00:03:51,154 --> 00:03:53,940
Now, now, stop grumbling. Time for bed.

20
00:03:56,050 --> 00:03:59,640
You need to sleep early so you can go to school. Otherwise, the witch will come kidnap you!

21
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:03,540
I'm a puppet! Why would she ever kidnap me?

22
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:11,000
That's right. Grandpa just can't help treating me like a real human child. Good night.

23
00:04:13,710 --> 00:04:16,279
I want to become a real human, too.

24
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:18,279
Good morning!

25
00:04:18,339 --> 00:04:18,899
Good morning!

26
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,320
Good morning!

27
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:24,160
Good morning!

28
00:04:24,161 --> 00:04:26,520
Good morning, Mokku! Did you do your homework?

29
00:04:27,165 --> 00:04:28,165
Oh no, I forgot!

30
00:04:28,405 --> 00:04:30,120
You'll be made to stand in the hallway again!

31
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:32,380
Yeah... me neither...

32
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,580
I hate math, too!

33
00:04:35,190 --> 00:04:42,420
Me too. Mama said a witch would come out last night, so I was terrified... / Me too! I was so scared!

34
00:04:43,570 --> 00:04:46,520
Scaredy-cats. Witches aren't real.

35
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:53,300
I watched the street all night. The only person who passed by was old lady Koshiki.

36
00:04:54,200 --> 00:05:00,800
But Grandpa said so. He said witches live in the Devil's Forest. And vampires, too.

37
00:05:01,460 --> 00:05:06,640
That's just superstition. I bet you were shivering in bed, praying to God.

38
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:11,280
I don't believe in witches either.

39
00:05:11,630 --> 00:05:14,840
I just thought if I told the teacher that, he'd forgive me for the homework.

40
00:05:14,990 --> 00:05:17,080
Then let's go explore the Devil's Forest right now.

41
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:20,140
If we go to school, they'll just make us stand in the hallway anyway.

42
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:24,320
Still... Mokku's just scared of the witch after all.

43
00:05:24,725 --> 00:05:27,040
Mokku is a chicken!

44
00:05:27,440 --> 00:05:30,660
I promised Grandpa I'd go straight to school!

45
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:34,420
Fine! We're not playing with a coward like you anymore!

46
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:35,500
Let's go!

47
00:05:35,840 --> 00:05:36,840
Yeah!

48
00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:38,700
I'll go too!

49
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:53,400
(Good night)

50
00:05:54,210 --> 00:05:55,920
Mokku, don't go!

51
00:05:56,325 --> 00:05:57,325
Shut up!

52
00:05:57,635 --> 00:05:59,780
Real courage means going to school!

53
00:06:00,325 --> 00:06:02,940
Mind your own business! I'm not a coward!

54
00:06:03,325 --> 00:06:05,580
If you go to the Devil's Forest, you'll regret it!

55
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:06,800
Out of my way!

56
00:06:08,370 --> 00:06:10,600
He's completely hopeless...

57
00:06:14,110 --> 00:06:15,110
[[MUSIC]]

58
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:25,040
I misjudged you, Mokku. There's no way witches exist.
Besides, I'm not scared at all!

59
00:06:29,730 --> 00:06:32,120
The foot of that mountain is the Devil's Forest.

60
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:38,140
I'm starting to get scared.

61
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:43,760
If there's a witch, I'll catch her. We'll make a fortune putting her on display.

62
00:06:45,340 --> 00:06:48,860
We'll be top-rate showmen. We'll take the whole world by storm!

63
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:50,500
Rosanna, what do you want to do?

64
00:06:50,940 --> 00:06:52,260
I don't want to go.

65
00:06:52,445 --> 00:06:55,960
Right. We've never come this far from home before.

66
00:06:56,285 --> 00:06:57,760
Mokku, let's go back.

67
00:06:58,290 --> 00:06:59,680
We came all this way!

68
00:07:00,310 --> 00:07:03,780
Suit yourself. But I said no girls allowed!

69
00:07:04,425 --> 00:07:05,060
Let's go.

70
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:06,400
Yeah.

71
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:12,080
Come on, Mokku. Let's go home. Everyone is worried.

72
00:07:12,405 --> 00:07:14,880
I'm a boy. I'm not going to be a coward.

73
00:07:15,020 --> 00:07:18,160
What's the matter, Mokku? If you're scared, go home with the girl.

74
00:07:18,805 --> 00:07:21,340
Wait! I'm coming! Hey!

75
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:37,480
Lino, you go in first.

76
00:07:37,780 --> 00:07:39,640
Marco, you go first.

77
00:07:39,760 --> 00:07:42,640
No way. Franco's supposed to be first!

78
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:45,080
Tch, look at you shivering.

79
00:07:47,550 --> 00:07:49,740
You're shaking too, Franco!

80
00:07:50,190 --> 00:07:51,720
I'm just trembling with excitement!

81
00:07:52,305 --> 00:07:53,305
I'll go.

82
00:08:06,730 --> 00:08:14,400
No child who ever entered that cursed forest has survived. May God protect them.

83
00:08:15,695 --> 00:08:17,580
All right, move out once you're ready!

84
00:08:19,380 --> 00:08:20,380
Wait!

85
00:08:20,895 --> 00:08:21,520
What is it?

86
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,100
What are you doing here?

87
00:08:24,100 --> 00:08:25,580
Please, take me with you.

88
00:08:26,165 --> 00:08:29,380
An old geezer like you would only slow us down.

89
00:08:30,075 --> 00:08:33,240
He is my beloved grandchild. Please!

90
00:08:33,615 --> 00:08:34,880
I said no, and that's final.

91
00:08:36,169 --> 00:08:37,220
All right, let's go, everyone.

92
00:08:40,219 --> 00:08:45,500
Take this. Put it on the end of a stick, and thrust it at the vampire if he appears.

93
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:56,300
Dear God, please protect me.

94
00:09:01,519 --> 00:09:02,519
Franco!

95
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:04,280
Gino!

96
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:05,760
Mama!

97
00:09:19,569 --> 00:09:20,569
So close!

98
00:09:23,460 --> 00:09:25,320
Damn it!

99
00:09:37,209 --> 00:09:43,160
Franco!

100
00:10:23,100 --> 00:10:25,840
Help me!

101
00:10:28,380 --> 00:10:39,920
I just want to die... Damn it!

102
00:10:56,460 --> 00:10:57,460
Franco!

103
00:11:02,020 --> 00:11:07,200
You're safe now. Daddy is here. / Papa... Papa, I'm sorry.

104
00:11:07,695 --> 00:11:08,695
What happened to Mokku?

105
00:11:11,285 --> 00:11:12,285
Lino!

106
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:13,560
Marco!

107
00:11:53,100 --> 00:11:54,100
(Ghostly sound)

108
00:12:00,789 --> 00:12:01,789
Hah!

109
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,240
(Ghost screech)

110
00:12:07,900 --> 00:12:08,900
(Ghost screech)

111
00:12:09,939 --> 00:12:11,720
What did you come here for?

112
00:12:12,130 --> 00:12:14,360
A-Are y-you a w-w-witch?

113
00:12:16,859 --> 00:12:23,140
Quite a feisty one, aren't you? As if there would be witches in these woods! (laughs)

114
00:12:38,659 --> 00:12:43,960
Mokku is my only reason for living. Dear God, please save him.

115
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:47,480
Old man!

116
00:12:48,339 --> 00:12:51,100
Where's Mokku? What about Mokku? Is he safe?

117
00:12:53,265 --> 00:12:56,820
No! That can't be! It can't be!

118
00:12:59,055 --> 00:13:02,000
Both Lino and Marco were eaten alive by wolves.

119
00:13:02,745 --> 00:13:05,200
My boy was the only one who managed to survive, but...

120
00:13:07,260 --> 00:13:15,960
It was my fault... "Study, study"... Forcing Mokku when he hated studying so much... Mokku, please forgive me...

121
00:13:16,159 --> 00:13:22,000
Be naughty, be lazy, be selfish, it doesn't matter! My boy, please just come back to me!

122
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:35,600
Really? No school or church, and we can just play from morning till night?

123
00:13:37,305 --> 00:13:40,680
That's right. This is a paradise for lazybones.

124
00:13:40,990 --> 00:13:42,580
I love the sound of that!

125
00:13:42,929 --> 00:13:46,620
Climbing trees, catching birds... I hate studying!

126
00:13:48,430 --> 00:13:49,520
Is that so?

127
00:13:50,324 --> 00:13:52,320
I'm so glad I met you, granny.

128
00:13:52,610 --> 00:13:55,600
Are you now, are you now? You're a good boy.

129
00:13:57,180 --> 00:13:59,760
Look over there, see?

130
00:14:06,599 --> 00:14:09,700
Wow, a castle! Can I really live there?

131
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:23,600
[[NO AUDIO]]

132
00:14:30,289 --> 00:14:32,920
It's pretty, but why are there only red flowers?

133
00:14:33,335 --> 00:14:38,201
Countess Leonard loves the color of blood. Hmm?

134
00:14:49,459 --> 00:14:53,980
Hello there! I'm Mokku. What's your name?

135
00:14:58,409 --> 00:15:01,680
These little people can't speak at all.

136
00:15:02,649 --> 00:15:03,649
Come along now.

137
00:15:13,919 --> 00:15:14,919
Incredible!

138
00:15:20,859 --> 00:15:23,920
Countess Leonard...

139
00:15:33,279 --> 00:15:35,420
I have returned.

140
00:15:36,195 --> 00:15:38,181
Good work. What is it?

141
00:15:49,949 --> 00:15:51,800
It looks like the Oak Tree Fairy.

142
00:15:52,459 --> 00:15:53,920
The Oak Tree Fairy?

143
00:15:54,385 --> 00:15:56,860
Yeah, she's like a mother to me, but...

144
00:15:57,225 --> 00:15:59,520
The Countess is much prettier.

145
00:15:59,949 --> 00:16:00,949
Oh, thank you.

146
00:16:01,689 --> 00:16:07,340
Then I shall be your mother from now on. / Really? I'd love that!

147
00:16:07,750 --> 00:16:11,300
Of course. I adore children, after all.

148
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:18,581
The other children were wearing crosses, so even the wolves... Poor things... / Do you mean Franco and the others?

149
00:16:19,325 --> 00:16:22,300
No, just some foolish children.

150
00:16:22,545 --> 00:16:23,840
I'm not foolish!

151
00:16:24,405 --> 00:16:28,620
I know. Come along. Let us go to my room.

152
00:16:35,129 --> 00:16:38,220
He was my husband, and the lord of this castle.

153
00:16:38,335 --> 00:16:39,800
He's dressed funny.

154
00:16:40,260 --> 00:16:43,380
Yes, he passed away a very long time ago.

155
00:16:45,259 --> 00:16:48,960
My family died out 500 years ago.

156
00:16:49,355 --> 00:16:52,140
500 years ago? Then how old are you, Countess?

157
00:16:53,220 --> 00:16:56,700
I am 521 years old. / What?!

158
00:16:58,300 --> 00:17:00,280
521 years old?!

159
00:17:03,319 --> 00:17:07,579
I'm the prince of the castle! I'm a prince! A prince!

160
00:17:09,500 --> 00:17:11,720
I'm a prince! A prince!

161
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:13,920
(Sobbing)

162
00:17:28,729 --> 00:17:31,140
Honestly, that Mokku is completely hopeless.

163
00:17:31,495 --> 00:17:35,780
Grandfather hasn't eaten a thing all day and has been worrying sick...

164
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:11,680
Please get some rest.

165
00:18:49,939 --> 00:18:53,100
He's not a human child.

166
00:19:01,379 --> 00:19:03,020
You are not a human child.

167
00:19:03,634 --> 00:19:05,520
Go sleep with the dwarfs.

168
00:19:15,149 --> 00:19:16,800
(Laughter)

169
00:19:22,239 --> 00:19:23,500
(Laughter)

170
00:19:48,220 --> 00:19:49,220
[[NO AUDIO]]

171
00:19:50,860 --> 00:19:51,860
[(LAUGHTER)]

172
00:20:06,559 --> 00:20:08,320
Hey, let's play, everyone!

173
00:20:08,709 --> 00:20:10,040
Why are you working so hard?

174
00:20:10,514 --> 00:20:12,900
We're allowed to play from morning till night here, right?

175
00:20:17,509 --> 00:20:20,780
Oh, I see. You can't speak.

176
00:20:21,615 --> 00:20:22,615
Look, heave-ho!

177
00:20:24,279 --> 00:20:25,460
See? Isn't it fun?

178
00:20:26,329 --> 00:20:28,460
You guys try it too! Come on!

179
00:20:29,215 --> 00:20:30,215
Come on!

180
00:20:37,249 --> 00:20:38,800
Something's strange...

181
00:20:44,859 --> 00:20:53,580
Just when I thought I could finally suck the blood of a healthy child... There isn't a single drop of blood in his body, only water.

182
00:20:54,704 --> 00:20:56,620
I have a good idea.

183
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:01,600
Mokku!

184
00:21:01,764 --> 00:21:02,764
Yes!

185
00:21:05,179 --> 00:21:06,180
What is it, Mama?

186
00:21:07,249 --> 00:21:09,480
Don't you want some friends?

187
00:21:10,219 --> 00:21:12,900
Yes, I want to be friends with the dwarfs, too.

188
00:21:13,309 --> 00:21:16,960
The dwarfs won't do. None of them can speak.

189
00:21:19,309 --> 00:21:30,960
So bring children from the village. Yes, a cute girl would be nice. You must have a girlfriend or two. / I sure do! Let's see... Anna, Rosanna, and Sophia? I'm surprisingly popular.

190
00:21:32,229 --> 00:21:37,221
Bring them all here. And make sure they take off their crosses. / Why?

191
00:21:37,389 --> 00:21:40,440
You hate school and church too, don't you, Mokku?

192
00:21:40,894 --> 00:21:45,340
Mama hates kids who go to church, too.
Yeah! I'm on my way!

193
00:21:46,089 --> 00:21:48,780
Good. Make sure you bring them.

194
00:22:14,220 --> 00:22:15,220
(Laughter)

195
00:22:16,779 --> 00:22:23,900
Mokku, now wherever you go, you will obey my every command.

196
00:22:24,445 --> 00:22:25,445
Now, go!

197
00:23:15,320 --> 00:23:16,440
(Laughter)

198
00:23:27,240 --> 00:23:28,240
[(LAUGHTER)]

199
00:23:34,529 --> 00:23:42,280
Bewitched and completely hollowed out inside, Mokku obeyed the vampire's orders and lured his friends behind the forest.

200
00:23:43,989 --> 00:23:46,300
At last, the long-awaited blood of healthy children is his to drink.

201
00:23:47,280 --> 00:23:53,000
The vampire finally reveals his terrifying true form and prepares to attack the young girls.

202
00:23:54,284 --> 00:23:57,620
What will become of Mokku and his friends?

203
00:23:58,434 --> 00:24:00,900
Tune in next week for Kashi no Ki Mokku!

